EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Well, you really came through for
me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'll remember that next time I 
need to fetch someone!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Pues sí que has cumplido, jef{{TAG:000E:0006:0200650002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Ahora ya sé a quién pedir ayuda
para hablar con la peña!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Tu m'as rendu un fier service !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je
saurai à qui demander la prochaine
fois que j'aurai besoin d'aide !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Hai fatto tanto per me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} La prossima
volta che dovrò andare a chiamare
qualcuno, me lo ricorderò!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Die Rumrennerei war doch ein tolles
Training!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ...War nur ein Witz.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du
warst mir 'ne große Hilfe.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Danke!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Vallahi beni yarı yolda bırakmadın!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir dahaki sefere birini çağırmam
gerektiğinde bunu hatırlayacağım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That was the classic chat-
and-dash move just now.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh well.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} We took care of what we
needed to take care of, anyway!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}And now, here's a little something{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}you're carrying a lot of stuff.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'll just mail you your reward later!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Az önce klasik "sohbet et ve kaç"
