al sana ufak bir şey{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa, {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}çok eşya taşıyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
